1
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:11,026
When Mikel Arteta was asked, after an Arsenal
friendly in Girona at the start of

2
00:00:11,076 --> 00:00:16,078
August, when Vinicius was coming, he
smiled, said thank you and walked out,

3
00:00:16,128 --> 00:00:21,678
and anyone watching assumed it was just another
manager dodging a transfer question.

4
00:00:22,028 --> 00:00:24,967
But according to the Spanish newspaper AS,

5
00:00:25,017 --> 00:00:28,315
it was Arteta himself who was
leading the talks,

6
00:00:28,365 --> 00:00:32,560
promising to make Vinicius the
centre of the English champions,

7
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:35,490
a team where even the wingers track back.

8
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:41,235
Five days later, Vinicius signed a new
deal with Real Madrid until 2032,

9
00:00:41,285 --> 00:00:44,910
and it looked as if the
story had ended there.

10
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:50,041
It came back in October, when he pulled
the hair of a Villarreal player,

11
00:00:50,091 --> 00:00:55,234
was handed a four-game ban and watched from
the outside as Real Madrid won all

12
00:00:55,284 --> 00:00:58,373
four, including the Clásico
at the Camp Nou,

13
00:00:58,423 --> 00:01:03,868
with a nineteen-year-old playing in his
position and doing exactly what Xabi Alonso

14
00:01:03,918 --> 00:01:07,914
had demanded from Vinicius a few
days before he was sacked.

15
00:01:20,664 --> 00:01:25,678
In less than a year, Vinicius had two chances
to become a different kind of player,

16
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:30,463
one with the coach who tried to change him
inside Real Madrid and one with the

17
00:01:30,513 --> 00:01:33,580
coach who offered him a whole
new club to do it,

18
00:01:33,630 --> 00:01:38,254
and both times he chose to stay where he
was, playing the way he always had.

19
00:01:38,604 --> 00:01:43,361
Now, with the ban served, he is back in a
Real Madrid side that has just spent a

20
00:01:43,411 --> 00:01:47,458
whole month winning without him, and
to understand how we got here,

21
00:01:47,508 --> 00:01:50,026
we have to go back to May of last year.

22
00:01:55,576 --> 00:02:00,440
Before we go back to the start of this story,
if you enjoy this kind of breakdown,

23
00:02:00,490 --> 00:02:02,787
hit like, subscribe to the channel,

24
00:02:02,837 --> 00:02:07,483
and send this video to that Madrid fan who
still thinks the club's problem has

25
00:02:07,533 --> 00:02:09,230
always been the manager.

26
00:02:13,980 --> 00:02:17,965
In May 2025, when Xabi Alonso was
unveiled at the Bernabéu,

27
00:02:18,015 --> 00:02:23,445
he made a point of saying that he wasn't
arriving with demands and that he had come

28
00:02:23,495 --> 00:02:28,744
to work as a team, and few people noticed
that this one word would end up at the

29
00:02:28,794 --> 00:02:33,562
centre of everything that happened to
Vinicius over the next few months.

30
00:02:42,912 --> 00:02:47,271
A month later, at the Club World Cup,
he explained what he meant:

31
00:02:47,321 --> 00:02:52,103
all eleven defend, no exceptions, and
that included Mbappé and Vinicius,

32
00:02:52,153 --> 00:02:57,539
who under Ancelotti had won two Champions
Leagues with almost total freedom on the

33
00:02:57,589 --> 00:03:02,854
left, and who six months earlier had been
named FIFA's best player in the world.

34
00:03:03,204 --> 00:03:06,886
It was a hard request to swallow at
that point in his career,

35
00:03:06,936 --> 00:03:10,186
and the first sign of it came
in the October Clásico.

36
00:03:10,536 --> 00:03:13,175
On the twenty-sixth of October 2025,

37
00:03:13,225 --> 00:03:16,782
Real Madrid beat Barcelona
two-one at the Bernabéu,

38
00:03:16,832 --> 00:03:20,754
and in the seventy-second minute
Xabi takes Vinicius off.

39
00:03:20,804 --> 00:03:24,055
He walks straight down the
tunnel complaining,

40
00:03:24,105 --> 00:03:28,456
and three days later he posts an
apology that mentions the fans,

41
00:03:28,506 --> 00:03:32,062
his teammates and the
president, but not the coach.

42
00:03:32,412 --> 00:03:37,090
Keep that minute in mind, seventy-two,
because it comes back later in this story.

43
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:40,564
On the fourth of January
2026, against Betis,

44
00:03:40,614 --> 00:03:44,935
the cameras catch Xabi shouting at
Vinicius not to stop pressing,

45
00:03:44,985 --> 00:03:49,426
and Vinicius answering that his
teammates should pass him the ball,

46
00:03:49,476 --> 00:03:53,797
and when he is substituted, the
Bernabéu whistles its own player.

47
00:03:53,847 --> 00:03:57,689
A few days later, before the
Super Cup, Xabi defends him,

48
00:03:57,739 --> 00:04:00,982
but makes it clear the
demand isn't going away.

49
00:04:18,932 --> 00:04:22,738
A week later, Real lose the Super
Cup final to Barcelona,

50
00:04:22,788 --> 00:04:26,654
and on the twelfth of January Xabi
Alonso leaves the club,

51
00:04:26,704 --> 00:04:29,442
seven and a half months after arriving.

52
00:04:29,792 --> 00:04:34,667
According to The Athletic, Vinicius had been
holding back on his contract renewal

53
00:04:34,717 --> 00:04:38,430
precisely to see whether Xabi would
stay, and with his exit,

54
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:43,356
the first attempt to turn Vinicius into a
different kind of player ended with the

55
00:04:43,406 --> 00:04:45,846
coach leaving and the player staying.

56
00:04:46,196 --> 00:04:50,703
The second would come from a manager who had
just proved in England that this way

57
00:04:50,753 --> 00:04:52,290
of playing wins titles.

58
00:04:57,040 --> 00:05:02,845
In May 2026, Mikel Arteta's Arsenal are
champions of England for the first time in

59
00:05:02,895 --> 00:05:06,878
twenty-two years, with the best
defence in the league,

60
00:05:06,928 --> 00:05:10,521
twenty-six goals conceded in
thirty-eight games,

61
00:05:10,571 --> 00:05:16,310
and Arteta has always explained what he asks
of his players in very simple terms.

62
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:26,773
In Madrid, Real bring in José
Mourinho to replace Arbeloa,

63
00:05:26,823 --> 00:05:32,402
and Vinicius reaches the summer with his
contract running out in 2027.

64
00:05:32,752 --> 00:05:37,204
That is when, according to AS, Arteta
personally takes over the talks,

65
00:05:37,254 --> 00:05:42,052
walks Vinicius through Arsenal's project
and promises he would be the team's

66
00:05:42,102 --> 00:05:45,111
reference on the left, in
Martinelli's place,

67
00:05:45,161 --> 00:05:50,190
while Real Madrid let it be known that they
won't accept less than a hundred and

68
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,806
fifty million euros.

69
00:05:52,156 --> 00:05:54,940
For the second time in less than a year,

70
00:05:54,990 --> 00:05:59,546
someone was offering Vinicius the chance
to become a different player,

71
00:05:59,596 --> 00:06:02,734
this time at a champion club
in a new country,

72
00:06:02,784 --> 00:06:05,745
and the answer came on the
sixth of August,

73
00:06:05,795 --> 00:06:08,756
when Real announced his
renewal until 2032,

74
00:06:08,806 --> 00:06:12,122
five days after that smile
from Arteta in Girona.

75
00:06:12,472 --> 00:06:17,889
That same summer, Real Madrid pay Leipzig
around a hundred and twenty-five million

76
00:06:17,939 --> 00:06:23,052
euros for a nineteen-year-old left winger
from the Ivory Coast, Yan Diomande,

77
00:06:23,102 --> 00:06:27,243
and when Mourinho is asked whether
he requested that signing,

78
00:06:27,293 --> 00:06:29,126
he doesn't dress it up.

79
00:06:34,476 --> 00:06:38,036
And if you're enjoying this story,
take a second to subscribe,

80
00:06:38,086 --> 00:06:40,666
because this is where it
starts to resolve.

81
00:06:45,416 --> 00:06:49,438
At the end of August, Mourinho
starts by defending Vinicius,

82
00:06:49,488 --> 00:06:52,492
saying he is unfairly
targeted in stadiums,

83
00:06:52,542 --> 00:06:57,462
but on the same day he makes a request
that another coach had already made.

84
00:07:14,812 --> 00:07:19,825
On the tenth of October, against
Villarreal, Vinicius starts on the bench,

85
00:07:19,875 --> 00:07:25,259
comes on in the second half and even scores,
but VAR rules the goal out because,

86
00:07:25,309 --> 00:07:28,778
in the same move, he pulled
Nathan Saliba's hair.

87
00:07:29,128 --> 00:07:32,397
The red card comes at around
seventy-two minutes,

88
00:07:32,447 --> 00:07:37,636
almost the same point on the clock at which he
had walked off angry in the Clásico

89
00:07:37,686 --> 00:07:42,818
a year earlier, and the goal that wins the
game for Real that night is Diomande's

90
00:07:42,868 --> 00:07:44,390
first for the club.

91
00:07:44,740 --> 00:07:47,188
Four days later comes a four-game ban,

92
00:07:47,238 --> 00:07:51,314
two games for the hair pull and two for
his protests at the referee.

93
00:07:51,664 --> 00:07:53,821
On the eve of the Sevilla game,

94
00:07:53,871 --> 00:07:58,688
Mourinho talks about him in a way that few
people expected to hear from a Real

95
00:07:58,738 --> 00:07:59,990
Madrid manager.

96
00:08:30,340 --> 00:08:35,347
He was talking about the racist abuse that
Vinicius has heard in Spanish stadiums

97
00:08:35,397 --> 00:08:38,416
for years, and on that he is
completely right,

98
00:08:38,466 --> 00:08:43,530
but it is hard to hear that sentence without
remembering that, two months earlier,

99
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:47,337
a club in another country had made
exactly that invitation,

100
00:08:47,387 --> 00:08:49,610
and that Vinicius chose to stay.

101
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,711
Ancelotti protected Vinicius for years,

102
00:08:52,761 --> 00:08:57,777
and the whole club did the same when it
stayed away from the 2024 Ballon d'Or

103
00:08:57,827 --> 00:09:03,201
ceremony, but Mourinho protects and demands at
the same time, and three days later,

104
00:09:03,251 --> 00:09:08,625
before a Champions League game, when he was
asked whether Vinicius was untouchable,

105
00:09:08,675 --> 00:09:13,214
he answered that the only untouchable
thing at the club is the badge.

106
00:09:13,564 --> 00:09:15,710
On the twenty-fifth of October,

107
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:20,720
Real Madrid go to the Camp Nou and win the
Clásico two-one while Vinicius watches

108
00:09:20,770 --> 00:09:25,787
from the outside, and a week later Arsenal
beat Liverpool at Anfield for the first

109
00:09:25,837 --> 00:09:29,671
time since 2012 and go back to the
top of the Premier League,

110
00:09:29,721 --> 00:09:34,738
which means the two clubs that fought over
Vinicius in the summer spent that month

111
00:09:34,788 --> 00:09:36,314
winning without him.

112
00:09:41,064 --> 00:09:45,678
During the ban, Real won all four
games, four-one against Sevilla,

113
00:09:45,728 --> 00:09:51,414
two-one against Barcelona, three-nil against
Racing and three-nil against Valencia,

114
00:09:51,464 --> 00:09:57,023
scoring twelve and conceding just two, and on
the left wing, in Vinicius's place,

115
00:09:57,073 --> 00:10:01,750
played Diomande, who scored against
Villarreal, Sevilla and Racing.

116
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:06,943
When Mourinho explained what he had seen
in him, he talked about pace and,

117
00:10:06,993 --> 00:10:09,329
above all, about defensive work,

118
00:10:09,379 --> 00:10:14,759
which is exactly what Xabi Alonso was
demanding from Vinicius in that January press

119
00:10:14,809 --> 00:10:17,265
conference that opened this video.

120
00:10:17,315 --> 00:10:21,442
And when Diomande arrived, he said
this about his new manager.

121
00:10:27,392 --> 00:10:32,407
And when Mourinho needed a comparison to
explain what that kid could still become,

122
00:10:32,457 --> 00:10:33,870
he chose Vinicius.

123
00:10:45,620 --> 00:10:50,894
Now, to be fair to Vinicius, it is worth
remembering that he is racially abused in

124
00:10:50,944 --> 00:10:54,324
stadium after stadium through
no fault of his own,

125
00:10:54,374 --> 00:10:57,755
that he has scored in two
Champions League finals,

126
00:10:57,805 --> 00:11:03,138
and that four games from a nineteen-year-old
are far too few for any final verdict.

127
00:11:03,488 --> 00:11:08,558
What all these coaches asked of him has to do
with what he does when the opponent

128
00:11:08,608 --> 00:11:13,562
has the ball, and that is what Diomande
delivered in the month he played in his

129
00:11:13,612 --> 00:11:14,368
place.

130
00:11:14,418 --> 00:11:17,934
Now that the ban is over,
Vinicius is back in La Liga.

131
00:11:18,284 --> 00:11:23,134
If you've made it this far, tell me in the
comments whether you think Vinicius was

132
00:11:23,184 --> 00:11:27,218
right to stay at Real Madrid or should
have taken the Arsenal move,

133
00:11:27,268 --> 00:11:30,594
and subscribe to follow what
happens to him from here.

134
00:11:30,944 --> 00:11:36,132
Xabi Alonso asked Vinicius to commit without
the ball and was sacked a week later,

135
00:11:36,182 --> 00:11:41,138
Arteta offered him a champion team where
that is the rule and was turned down,

136
00:11:41,188 --> 00:11:43,582
and in the month Vinicius was out,

137
00:11:43,632 --> 00:11:48,006
Real won every game with a kid who does
exactly what Xabi asked for.

138
00:11:48,356 --> 00:11:52,663
That day in Girona, when Arteta was
asked when Vinicius was coming,

139
00:11:52,713 --> 00:11:55,626
he smiled and walked out
without answering,

140
00:11:55,676 --> 00:12:00,854
and the answer that matters now is the one
Vinicius himself will give on the pitch

141
00:12:00,904 --> 00:12:02,074
from here on:

142
00:12:02,124 --> 00:12:06,954
whether there is still time to become the
player Xabi and Arteta saw in him.
